The tables in this folder (objects.csv.gz, fovs.csv.gz) are derived from unpublished data of
the Jacquemet lab, provided by Guillaume Jacquemet on 2026-09-30:
file "Tracking_data_CCT8_CCT7_silencing_Glioma.csv" (sha256 dec991b3...233e), from the
project of the article "CCT8 associates with the MYO10 motor domain and regulates filopodia
and breast cancer cell invasion", Journal of Cell Science (2026),
https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.265278, but not part of it.

