Changes: metadata columns renamed to the MorphoBricks names (verbatim labels kept under a
source_ prefix), both siCTRL labels written siCTRL, the well and position parsed from the
results file names, three redundant identifier columns dropped, rows reordered; no value
changed, and the 28 tracks that appear twice in the source are kept
(data/lab/cct7_cct8_glioma_cdm_tracks/convert.py).
